"TERA manual: P7 = 0 IMG BUS (CAR V2), 2 = third-party remote on 44 / 41 (the DHW setpoint and max. flow then stay on the boiler panel); 1 = not available. The forum said P7 = 1 – check on the boiler.": "Návod TERA: P7 = 0 IMG BUS (CAR V2), 2 = ovládač inej firmy na 44 / 41 (požadovaná TÚV a max. výstup potom zostávajú na paneli kotla); 1 = nedostupné. Na fóre sa písalo P7 = 1 – overte na kotle.",
